# Normaliza fins de linha para LF no repositorio e na working tree.
# Sobrepoe core.autocrlf=true (Windows) para que o Prettier (endOfLine: lf) nao reclame.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binarios: nunca normalizar
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.svg binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.lock binary